sequenceDiagram
    participant T as Host harness
    participant H as Host file
    participant R as Runtime
    participant U as Qt editor
    participant V as VNC path
    T->>H: Create empty file, permissions 0600
    T->>R: Start container and bind this file
    T->>R: Wait for desktop and launch editor
    R->>U: Start editor with mounted output path
    T->>V: Authenticate and request screenshot
    V-->>T: Initial window framebuffer
    T->>V: Mouse press, motion, release
    V->>U: Window drag through compositor
    T->>V: Request second screenshot
    V-->>T: Window framebuffer after drag
    T->>T: Measure banner displacement
    T->>V: Click editor, type text, press Ctrl+S
    V->>U: Keyboard and pointer events
    U->>H: Save text through the bind mount
    T->>H: Read and compare exact content
    T->>T: Save screenshots, JSON and logs
    T->>R: Remove test container
